    "ui.mainmenus.difficultytype.hard.tooltip.Description": "Hydration, Sustenance & Rest decrease faster and can reduce Health to 0%.\r\nEnemy attacks deal more damage.\r\nEnemies have more Health.\r\nWeaknesses & Resistances affects are increased.\r\nSkill XP beyond your current level is lost on death.\r\nOnly one gravestone may be active at a time. If you die with a gravestone active the oldest gravestone and all its contents will be lost. ",
