    "AD36009E49ADE8106305AAA540D1DA4F": "It seems like it might be weaking the power of the shield around the village.",
    "F1615A3B462F321CEB330ABE5E8D2779": "It'll take some time for the land to heal, but when it does it'll remember the good work you've done for it. The land always remembers.",
