    "5EE480C2441A51D1AC5E3383B7694E39": "That's enough.",
    "648FC4604B0703F10426FF83CBF72D56": "The Armadyl Statue Awaits!",
    "95CFF84B4E428D43B3AC3D8BC40E7E11": "The Guthix Statue Awaits!",
    "E155A00243ED927C722D08BCC7B7A7B9": "The Saradomin Statue Awaits!",
    "CB9EA72C46C44CE25485D681E95020B5": "The Spirit of Velgar lives on within this shield corrupting your enemies.",
    "E92D5AA34342ED070C5DD7AF46EB40A4": "The Zamorak Statue Awaits!",
    "E0B8D1184B342C318CC2EC8D0181BA98": "The blueprints for an infamous weapon. Its individual components require special resources and Garou stonemasonry.",
    "105307FB493A870BA6AF0A8EE33669F2": "The dungeon cannot be deleted:\r\nthere are players in it, \r\nor there is no dungeon",
    "9BC031BC45CA42AE6B1A758895BE8372": "The dungeon cannot be deleted:\r\nthere are players in it, \r\nor there is no dungeon",
    "232010B145AACBD11F5EA5B92589CF24": "The mouthpiece of the Challenge Horn, carved out of a dragon tooth.",
    "0F398367445D42016E01FFA34C5EB9B0": "The sinister remnants of an abyssal creature. ",
    "16D4AF004EA96C4389C2D7AF77F963E7": "The skin of a savage beast.",
    "6ECB77994A53EB34D5CB2CB661A635C0": "The spine from a deceased Abyssal Demon",
    "1418861542FEAD05AE0B428BFBD3BCF9": "The statue hums with power.",
    "C3B9CD2A4AB90D8FDD285F9F13E61126": "The sword of a Goblin Chieftan, used to spread war in the name of the Big High War God.",
    "2704537D405723D17B3B748F57D84B14": "The tanned hide of a savage beast.",
    "772F7945450E782722510A9E621AC980": "There is no ore nearby!",
    "73082CA845EA99CB22B5A6973D8F20A7": "They had to do it to protect the village.",
    "0F49A9A54E9488E284DE94A7E03E0AD1": "They just felt like it.",
    "073A746D4013D2437140B98AA6DA725C": "They murdered someone!",
    "B9F0DF08423C12CB2802EA936955BB7E": "They stole someones armour!",
    "30CDEE7042D5642DC32EA88B8951241A": "They were a jealous lover.",
    "67CF746A4AE36BB50E38679D5543EE70": "They were hording all the cabbages!",
    "2359E21740FBF7B1730AACB3BD80BF42": "Thick 26° Beam",
