    "DC4E483B47B8E912EF163590DC61151C": "This bowl is empty.",
    "F3D997674DDC9344D51B42AC38CDFDFD": "This can be used as an ultra-efficient heat source, or as a decorative crafting material.",
    "FEC7318545B6FF4CC51A9DADD6FD93CE": "This kiln can slowly burn wood resources such as logs or planks into charcoal - a highly efficient fuel source. Pottery pieces can also be fired in this kiln.",
    "24B85BA74D274E68B3DCEEAC093C9D45": "This land is fully of forgotten and mysterious palces!",
