    "ui.mainmenus.landing.newsfeed.Body": "We're delighted to have you on this journey with us.\r\nPardon our dust: the project is in early access, so you may encounter \r\nbugs or issues during your time in-game. Balancing and content is \r\nnot yet final.\r\n\r\nWe want to hear from you! We’ve got a range of social channels, \r\nincluding our Discord where we’ll be using community feedback to \r\ninform the future roadmap of the game. We’re always on the lookout \r\nfor feedback, so stay tuned for more updates! Until then, have fun!\r\n\r\n– The RuneScape: Dragonwilds Team",
