    "DifficultySetting.TeleportationCostScale.Description": "The scale of Lodestone Teleportation Rune costs",
    "DifficultySetting.SpellCooldownScale.Description": "The scale of Spell Cooldown times",
    "DifficultySetting.SpellCostScale.Description": "The scale of Spell Rune costs",
    "DifficultySetting.XPGainScale.Description": "The scale of XP gained from events that grant XP",
    "DifficultySetting.AICategoryScaling.DamageScale.Description": "The scale of damage caused",
    "DifficultySetting.PlayerHealthScale.Description": "The scale of health available",
    "DifficultySetting.LifewardScale.Description": "The scale of lifeward available",
    "DifficultySettings.PlayerStaminaScale.Description": "The scale of stamina available",
    "DifficultySetting.AICategoryScaling.HealthScale.Description": "The scale of the enemies health",
    "DifficultySetting.BuildingMaterialCostScale.Description": "The scale of the material cost of building pieces",
    "DifficultySetting.CraftingCostScale.Description": "The scale of the material cost of crafted items",
    "DifficultySetting.PlayerResistancesScale.Description": "The scale of the resistences to damage types the player / AI might have",
    "DifficultySetting.AICategoryScaling.ResistancesScale.Description": "The scale of the weaknessess to damage types the player / AI might have",
    "DifficultySettings.ProcessingSpeedScale.Description": "The scale of time required to process materials",
    "DifficultySetting.InventoryCarryCapacityScale.Description": "The scale of your maximum inventory weight capacity",
    "DifficultySetting.ThirstKills": "Thirst Kills",
    "DifficultySettings.SettingCantBeChangedAfterWorldCreation": "This cannot be changed after world creation.",
    "DifficultySetting.XPGainScale": "XP Gain Scale",
    "DifficultySetting.ThirstKills.Description": "You can die from not drinking",
    "DifficultySetting.HungerKills.Description": "You can die from not eating"
  },
  "ST_DragonSlayer": {
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons4": "\"Queen Kuldra bids you welcome,\" they laughed, as our comrades drew their final breaths.",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_SummonVelgar": "<Place the horn and summon Velgar>",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_DontSummonVelgar": "<Step away from the altar>",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_IRecogniseYou1": "A lifetime of heroism, and no recognition. But you rob one bank, and suddenly everyone knows your name!",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotOneHead3": "A little rude, but, fine, whatever. He's dead and that's all I really care about.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_MadeHorn1": "Ah, I see you've made the horn to summon Velgar. Good, good.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_HasOneHead1": "Ah, got yourself a dragon head there. Hand it over, I'll turn it into something useful.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_HasManyHeads1": "Ah, got yourself a... disturbing number of dragon heads. I'm trying very hard not to judge.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_NoItems1": "Ah, look at you, all fresh-faced and green, itching for adventure. I remember those days. Good times",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestNotStarted_UnlockedRecipe1": "Ah, look at you, all fresh-faced and green, itching for adventure. I remember those days. Good times.",
    "AskAboutDragonSlayer": "Ask about Dragon Slayer",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_NoHeads4": "Because the calm always precedes the storm.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutVelgar3": "But he's big, scary and he wants to make all of us wyrm food. So, diplomacy's out.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasOneHead3": "But no need, everything's fine! For now at least.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons2": "But then dragons happened.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasManyHeads1": "But, we'll worry about that later. Here, let me take that slimey, smelly dragon he... why do you have so many of them?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasOneHead5": "But, we'll worry about that later. Here, let me take that slimey, smelly dragon head off you.",
    "CanYouGiveMeAnyEquipment": "Can you give me any equipment?",
    "CanYouTellMeAboutCathan": "Can you tell me about Cathan?",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_AskAboutVelgar": "Can you tell me about General Velgar?",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_AskAboutKuldra": "Can you tell me about Queen Kuldra?",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_AskAboutDragons": "Can you tell me about the dragons?",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_AskAboutPreviousAdventurer": "Can you tell me about the previous adventurer?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_BothRecipePieces_3": "Cathan seems to have worked out the shape from the goblin investigation. Good lad. Here, this should let you make it. ",
    "CathanJournal_Vault_Title": "Cathan's diary",
    "CathanJournal_VelgarsLair_Title": "Cathan's farewell",
    "CathanJournal_Castle_Title": "Cathan's journal",
    "CathanJournal_Vannaka_Title": "Cathan's note",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutCathan11": "Cathan, now there was a pain in the neck.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasManyHeads2": "Do you just carry multiple heads around with you? Is that normal to you?",
    "Title": "Dragon Slayer",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasManyHeads3": "Eh, whatever, I've seen weirder. Hand them over, I'll turn them into something more useful.",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective5": "Find the ingredients and craft the Challenge Horn. Check the recipe in your journal for more information",
    "WoM_DragonSalyer_CanYouTellMeAboutQueenKuldra2": "From what I can gather, she's something like royalty to the dragons here; never a good sign.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutVelgar1": "General Velgar, let that sink in. A title, on a dragon, not a good sign.",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_TradeInDragonHead": "Give the Wise Old Man Velgar's Head?",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_TradeInDragonHeads": "Give the Wise Old Man all of your Velgar heads?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_MadeHorn4": "Go summon and stab a dragon. Repeatedly and with relish!",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_AcceptQuest1": "Good. Your first target is a particularly nasty dragon; General Velgar. A dragon with a rank. Never a good sign.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutCathan3": "Got into scraps as a kid. Lost his leg to a wolf. Say what you want, he had guts that kid.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotOneHead4": "Hand over the head. I'll turn it into a visage, which you can use to craft something much more fun.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_FoundOneJournal_VaultJournalFound1": "He mentioned something about a castle on a hill. You should look around there.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_FoundOneJournal_CastleJournalFound1": "He mentioned something about a strange door in the swamp. You should try and find it.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutCathan5": "He was a constant annoyance—loud, irritating, overflowing with relentless optimism. You know the type. Even so, his absence leaves a void.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_AcceptQuest3": "He was chasing a trail of ancient lost knowledge, seeking a recipe for an item rumoured to summon Velgar to battle.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_NoProgress1": "How's the dragon hunt going? Not made any progress yet I see.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_FoundOneJournal1": "How's your hunt for the dragon going?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_FoundOneJournal2": "Hrmm, young Cathan left a journal did he? I wonder if there's another one.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotManyHeads3": "I don't know whether to be impressed or horrified.",
    "WoM_DragonSalyer_CanYouTellMeAboutQueenKuldra4": "I don't like that. Not one itty little bit.",
    "WoM_DragonSalyer_CanYouTellMeAboutQueenKuldra1": "I know very little about this Kuldra character, except that Velgar pledged his loyalty to her.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestNotStarted_UnlockedRecipe5": "I must say, it's refreshing to see someone with initiative these days.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotRecipe2": "I think your next steps are pretty clear, no? Go make it.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestNotStarted_UnlockedRecipe3": "I was going to ask how you feel about slaying dragons, but it looks you've already gotten started.",
    "CathanJournal_VelgarsLair": "I was going to fight a dragon, until a dragonkin showed up. They were waiting in the shadows, as if they knew that I’d be there. At first I drew my sword, ready to battle the creature, yet there was an odd sort of gentleness to their stance, as though their attention was very far away.\r\n\r\nWe spoke, and I cannot quite put the conversation into words. I remember they never made eye contact, and their fingers flicked and tapped against them as if remembering some strange sort of music. It was oddly calming and yet I’ve never felt more tense.\r\n\r\nThey warned me that Velgar isn’t the real danger, and they made it clear that my destiny was not to be his bane. There is someone else for that. Someone arriving soon, who will make the dragon pay for his crimes.\r\n\r\nMy destiny lies elsewhere. Working on the true danger – Queen Kuldra, the god-eater.\r\n\r\nMy new friend tells me that I have a part to play in her downfall, and even though I have only just met them, I believe them – as if we have always known one another.\r\n\r\nI leave now, deeper into this continent. If you find this, adventurer, then do one thing for me? Kick Velgar’s scaley ass.\r\n\r\n<There is a crude drawing of a knight kicking a dragon’s behind. The dragon does not seem happy with this situation>",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotOneHead2": "I was going to task you with slaying them, but you already have. Just ignored me completely and went right to his lair.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_NoHeads1": "I'd say things were much quieter without Velgar around, but I'm not sure that's true. ",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_NoHeads3": "I'll keep an ear open, I'll let you know if I hear anything of note. In the meantime, explore, craft, enjoy yourself.",
    "HeadOut": "I'm ready to head out <End Conversation>",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_BothRecipePieces_4": "I've made some notes in your journal to help you find some of the ingredients. They're in Ghornfell though, so you'll want to be prepared.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_NoHeads2": "If Cathan is still out there, then it implies there's more dangerous stuff on the horizon than one chonking-great dragon. ",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_BothRecipePieces_2": "If my dragonkin translation is right, and it is, this script looks like the instructions for a device to summon and challenge Velgar.",
    "CathanJournal_Castle": "I’ve always wanted to be an explorer. To journey far from home, see sights no one has ever seen before. So, imagine my surprise when I get here and see Lumbridge, bloody, castle. Or its twin, anyway.\r\n\r\nIts walls are crumbling, there’s no way to get inside. It’s surrounded by goblins and for some reason the fires burn blue. Yet the shape, the style, unforgettable. I bet Zanik has a theory about it. She always does.\r\n\r\nThe goblins were all dancing around praising the dragon. They were chanting “Velgar, Velgar, Velgar”, as if his name were a prayer. Like they are calling to him, trying to summon him down.\r\n\r\nTheir leaders all had these strange wooden horns that they blew as part of this chant. It’s clear that they’re emulating something. It’s obvious that this is a clue. I stole one of the pieces, so I can get a sense of the shape and I think I have an idea about where else to look. There were symbols on the horns that matches the writing by that door in the swamp. \r\n\r\nI’ll take a look there next. The best secrets lay buried, after all.  \r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective3": "Locate Cathan's journal behind a blue-flamed door in the swamps",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective2": "Locate Cathan's journal inside a castle",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective1": "Locate Cathan's journals in a castle, and behind a blue-flamed door in the Swamps",
    "CathanJournal_Vault": "My old mentor, a very wise man, once told me that the best secrets lay buried, so I found my way here. An ancient Dragonkin vault, hidden away in the marshland. The secrets of the creatures once confined to myth.\r\n\r\nAnd I’ve found what I’m looking for. The next part of the summoning horn, the device that will bring Velgar down within range of my sword. The dragonkin have created these creatures, these guardians by modifying rune essence into a strange sort of design. Channelling magic in specific patterns, spells layered over spells in ways runes cannot do.\r\n\r\nThis is what I need to complete the horn. Well, that and some materials that resonate with the magic. Maybe dragon tooth for the horn, and something to conduct the power? Bronze feels appropriate, but it’ll need something to lure him. A mystical resonance of conflict and death.\r\n\r\nI wonder if there are any bloodwood trees on Ashenfall? The sap of one of those would be the perfect catalyst. Something a dragon warrior could never ignore. They grow where death and slaughter are constant. Some really unpleasant place that I really don’t want to visit.\r\n\r\nOh well, who ever said adventuring was easy?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_NoItems3": "Now, tell me, how do you feel about slaying dragons?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasOneHead2": "OK, that's a lie, I was pretty sure you were dead and I was working out what to say to the next adventurer.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_RefuseHandOverVelgarsHead": "OK... not sure why you want to keep that slimey thing in your backpack, but you do you I guess.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_RefuseHandOverVelgarsHeads": "OK... not sure why you want to keep those slimey things in your backpack, but you do you I guess.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_BothRecipePieces_1": "Oh? Young Cathan found something did he? Clever lad, let me take a look at those for a moment.",
    "CathanJournal_Vannaka": "Old Vannaka’s an odd chap. Loyal to a fault, but not one to show affection. I still remember how he trained me, instilling me with a hatred for him that pushed me right past the pain. He was merciless, he was relentless, his training made me ache every day. So I took months of resentment and I balled them into a fist and with all of my loathing rammed it right into his face.  \r\n\r\nHe was so proud. So proud that I punched him. So pleased with me for bruising his jaw. Because that was the first time I had walked on my new leg, without having to think through every painful motion.\r\n\r\nHe had given me something else to turn my loathing on, that wasn’t myself.\r\n\r\nThat lummox took a broken kid, ready to give up on the world, and turned him into a warrior.\r\n\r\nHe’s a good man, Vannaka, even if he won’t always admit it. So of course, I said I’d join him on this new adventure.\r\n\r\nI feel like there’s more than just a curiosity here for him. Something deeper. Something hidden. A pain behind the eyes. So, yeah, I’ll help him find what he’s looking for. It’s what a good friend does.",
    "Description": "Recruited with promises of glory, your first challenge is to defeat General Velgar.",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_RefuseToHandOverHead": "Refuse to give the Wise Old Man Velgar's head.",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_RefuseToHandOverHeads": "Refuse to give the Wise Old Man Velgar's heads.",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective7": "Return to the Wise Old Man",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestFinished_HasManyHeads2": "Right, hand them over. I'll turn them into something useful.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons5": "So here's the deal: I need you to kill them all. Show these dragons and their Queen, that we're not just going to roll over and die.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotManyHeads2": "So, you completely ignored me. Walked right up to a dragon and then killed him several times?",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective4": "Speak to the Wise Old Man, to tell him what you've learned",
    "DragonSlayer_Objective6": "Summon and defeat Velgar",
    "AcceptQuest": "Sure, on it <Accept Quest>",
    "PlayerChoice_DragonSlayer_AcceptQuest": "Sure, on it! <Accept Quest>",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestNotStarted_UnlockedRecipe4": "That summoning horn recipe looks like it'll call down that blasted dragon. So go do that, and get rid of the blighter.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasOneHead4": "That's one dragon down, but there are more out there. Probably stronger and nastier than Velgar was.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutCathan4": "The \"legendary\" swordsman Vannaka taught him the art of swordplay, while I instructed him in the arcane.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_AcceptQuest4": "The last reports had him investigating two locations: a castle, and a door of blue flames set deep within a swamp.",
    "SummoningAltar_DragonSlayer_NoHorn_NotGotRecipe": "There is an indentation in the altar where something would be placed, but you are not sure what it might be. ",
    "SummoningAltar_DragonSlayer_HasHorn": "There is an indentation that would fit the summoning horn, if you are ready to summon Velgar. ",
    "SummoningAltar_DragonSlayer_NoHorn_GotRecipe": "There is an indention in the altar where something would be placed. It looks like it would fit the shape of Cathan's summoning horn design. ",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_AcceptQuest2": "There was a lad before you, an adventurer in training, who was on Velgar's trail. Good kid, Dead now. Very sad.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons3": "They swooped down from the skies and decimated the landing party. Whole teams of people, gone, just like that.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_MadeHorn3": "Venture to that great big tower off in Ghornfell .",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutVelgar2": "We don't know much at the moment, since everyone who's seen him is dead.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons6": "We fight back, and we fight back hard.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_ArentYouGoingToGiveMeEquipment3": "We're barely scraping by with what little we have left. Weapons? Equipment? The Dragons turned them to ash.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_ArentYouGoingToGiveMeEquipment2": "We're huddled in this ancient church, with roof tiles one strong wind away from crashing down on our heads.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_ArentYouGoingToGiveMeEquipment1": "What? Do we look like we're made of coin?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotManyHeads4": "Whatever, hand over the heads and I'll turn them into something more useful.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_TellMeMoreAboutTheseDragons1": "When my comrades and I set foot on Ashenfall, we thought it would be paradise. Lush green fields, tall and resilient trees – a world unsullied.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_MadeHorn2": "Why in the name of Saradomin's itchy eyeball are you still here then?",
    "Bloodwood_dont_get_sap": "You already have the bloodwood sap, you don't need more and it's really sticky. ",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_HasOneHead1": "You did it! I had no doubt you'd succeed.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_ArentYouGoingToGiveMeEquipment4": "You look capable enough. Go scavenge for what you need. If you need guidance, Zanik outside can point you in the right direction.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_Intro_NoItems2": "You must be either incredibly brave or utterly mad to have joined this expedition. But I'm glad our recruitment efforts managed to catch your eye.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestNotStarted_UnlockedRecipe2": "You must be either incredibly brave or utterly mad to have joined this expedition. But I'm glad our recruitment efforts managed to catch your eye.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotOneHead1": "You must be either incredibly brave or... that's a dragon's head in your backpack.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotManyHeads1": "You must be either incredibly brave or... that's a dragon's head in your backpack. No, wait, that's lots of heads.",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_NoProgress2": "You need to investigate the places my apprentice last visited: a castle, and a door of blue flames set deep within a swamp.",
    "Bloodwood_get_sap": "You siphon off some bloodwood sap from the tree. ",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_QuestStarted_GotRecipe1": "You've got the instructions on how to make a horn to summon Velgar?",
    "WoM_DragonSlayer_CanYouTellMeAboutCathan2": "Young noble sprog, low down the pecking order. Fifth son, I think. Wanted to be a hero, you know how it goes.",
    "Wom_DragonSlayer_AntiDragonShieldKnowledge": "Your mind fills with the knowledge of a new crafting recipe... but at what cost?",
    "WoM_DragonSalyer_CanYouTellMeAboutQueenKuldra3": "she's spoken of not with the reverence due a monarch, but with the devotion due a deity."
  },
  "ST_DragonSlayer_v2": {
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons4": "\"Queen Kuldra bids you welcome,\" they laughed, as our comrades drew their final breaths.",
    "PlayerChoice_GiveWoMHead": "<Hand over Velgar's head>",
    "PlayerChoice_GiveWoMHeads": "<Hand over all of your Velgar heads>",
    "PlayerChoice_SummonVelgar": "<Place the horn and summon Velgar>",
    "PlayerChoice_DenyWoMHead": "<Refuse to hand over Velgar's head>",
    "PlayerChoice_DenyWoMHeads": "<Refuse to hand over your Velgar heads>",
    "PlayerChoice_DontSummonVelgar": "<Step away from the altar>",
    "WoM_DS_GotHorn1": "Ah excellent, you've got one, we can begin. This ritual is a bit old school, proper druidic guff, but it's handy in a pinch.",
    "WoM_DS_GotHorn5": "Ah... the castle, not ideal. That place is a veritable goblin stronghold. Go see if you can find him, but make sure you're geared up for a fight.",
    "WoM_DS_FoundCathanJournal1": "Any sign of young Cathan? What -- he escaped, even managed to turn a few goblins to his cause? Interesting lad that, going to go places.",
    "WoM_DS_MadeBed3": "Anyway, look, we're set up here, but there's one of our number missing. Young Cathan, an adventurer in training that came along with us.",
    "Goblin_DS_TooEarly": "Argh, leave me alone human. ",
    "Cathan_DS_DoesNotHaveHorn3": "As death's go it could have been more heroic. Not exactly what I wanted on my epitaph. But, hey, silver cloud, you can avenge me now!",
    "WoM_DS_AboutGarou3": "Beastmen from another world, living only for the hunt. Best avoided if you can, but be prepared for a tough fight where you can't.",
    "WoM_DS_NeedVelgarHead2": "Bring me his head and I'll make sure you're rewarded. ",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToCathan_NotKilledVelgar3": "Build the horn. Summon Velgar. Avenge Cathan, save us all. Punch a dragon in the face!",
    "Cathan_DS_HasHorn2": "But be ready, once you summon Velgar, he'll not give you a chance to change your mind.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutVelgar3": "But he's big, scary and he wants to make all of us wyrm food. So, diplomacy's out.",
    "WoM_DS_NotFoundCathanGhost2": "But if the entrance to Ghornfel is what you say, it sounds like Cathan has been captured...again... so I need you to go and rescue him. ",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons2": "But then dragons happened.",
    "Cathan_DS_DoesNotHaveHorn2": "But then his garou minions mobbed me and dragged me here. They held me down as Velgar watched, laughing as they sacrificed me!",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToGoblin2": "But, if he's braving the garou, he must know a way of dealing with Velgar. There's no other reason he'd do something quite so stupid.",
    "WoM_DS_HasManyHeads1": "But, we'll worry about that later. Here, let me take that slimey, smelly dragon he... why do you have so many of them?",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutKuldra": "Can you tell me about Queen Kuldra?",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutVelgar": "Can you tell me about Velgar?",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutDragonkin": "Can you tell me about the Dragonkin?",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutGarou": "Can you tell me about the Garou?",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutCathan": "Can you tell me about the previous adventurer?",
    "CathanJournal_Castle_title": "Cathan's Journal [Castle]",
    "CathanJournal_Ghornfell_Title": "Cathan's Journal [Ghornfell]",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToCathan_NotKilledVelgar1": "Cathan's dead? To shreds you say? Poor lad, not the end he deserved. But Velgar's made a mistake here, he's made this personal.",
    "CathanJournal_Vannaka_Title": "Cathan's note",
    "WoM_DS_AboutCathan1": "Cathan, now there was a pain in the neck.",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn_Struggling2": "Discover, learn and improve. That's going to need to be your mantra on Ashenfall if you're going to survive. So find new materials, discover new recipes and then make them.",
    "WoM_DS_HasManyHeads2": "Do you just carry multiple heads around with you? Is that normal to you?",
    "WoM_DS_Intro4": "Doesn't need to be fancy -- though style is always worth pursuing -- but it needs to be functional. Make a shelter, some foundations, walls, and a roof, and then build and claim a bed in it.",
    "WoM_DS_NotFinishedTutorial1": "Don't get ahead of yourself young whippersnapper, go finish up what the others are asking you to do. Come see me after all that.",
    "Title": "Dragon Slayer",
    "WoM_DS_HasManyHeads3": "Eh, whatever, I've seen weirder. Hand them over, I'll turn them into something more useful.",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn_Struggling4": "Find feathers to make arrows, and then you're good to go. While you're at it, look for recipes that will let you make stronger gear. You're going to need it.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutKuldra2": "From what I can gather, she's something like royalty to the dragons here; never a good sign.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutVelgar1": "General Velgar, let that sink in. A title, on a dragon, not a good sign.",
    "WoM_DS_HeadIntoGhornfell2": "Ghornfell is a dangerous place, and home to the garou beastmen. Keep your wits about you. ",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToGoblin4": "Ghornfell's no joke though, that's where the garou live and if you thought goblins were trouble you're in for a shock.",
    "WoM_DS_MadeBed1": "Good, you've built a shelter. I mean... it could do with some work, we're gonna be here a while. Have you considered the decor at all?",
    "WoM_DS_Intro1": "Good, you've got the basics under your belt, but now the guide ropes are off. Taking down a dragon won't be easy, but you've got the skills you need to do it. Well... almost.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutCathan3": "Got into scraps as a boy. Lost his leg to a wolf. Say what you want, he had guts that kid.",
    "Goblin_DS_VaultConvo2": "Got us all riled up. Promised us power and glory. Said he knews how to get rid of the big scaly war king.",
    "WoM_DS_MadeBed4": "He disappeared after we got the lodestone working, vanished before you arrived. I'd like to track him down. To do that I need to cast a locator spell.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutCathan5": "He was a constant annoyance—loud, irritating, overflowing with relentless optimism. You know the type. Even so, his absence leaves a void.",
    "WoM_DS_HasVelgarHead3": "Here, I'll take that rapidly decomposing head off you and give you something much better in return.",
    "Cathan_DS_DoesNotHaveHorn4": "Here, let me teach you a recipe. It's a dragonkin horn that will force Velgar to battle. It's got to be used here, in an altar on the tower, but Velgar can't refuse it.",
    "WoM_DS_SpokeToGoblin6": "Here, this'll help get you started. ",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToGoblin5": "Horrible creatures, the garou. Deadly beastmen with no concept of mercy. You'll need to make sure you're as prepared as you can be, before you risk facing them in battle.",
    "WoM_DS_DeerCheck_Intro": "Hrmm? How are you getting on? Got me any antlers yet?",
    "WoM_DS_AboutGarou1": "I don't have much for you there, Vannaka's the one investigating them. He's pushing his way into Ghornfell, you should look for him there.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutKuldra4": "I don't like that. Not one itty little bit.",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToCathan_NotKilledVelgar2": "I generally discourage violence, but this time I think you need to gather as much of it as possible and serve up a dragon sized portion.",
    "WoM_DS_NotFoundCathanGhost3": "I imagine the garou will be taking him to Velgar. Make your way to the tower, and pray you're not too late. ",
    "WoM_DS_AboutKuldra1": "I know very little about this Kuldra character, except that Velgar pledged his loyalty to her.",
    "WoM_DS_HeadIntoGhornfell1": "I need you to gear yourself up as best you can, then push into Ghornfel to look for young Cathan. ",
    "Goblin_DS_PostDialogue": "I still ain't talkin' to no stinky human. Get lost!",
    "WoM_DS_MadeBed5": "I'm just missing one ingredient, which I'll need from you. Antlers. You can get them from deer, hunt one and bring me the antlers. Then we'll get started. But first, here, take this. ",
    "WoM_DS_NoSpaceInInventory": "I've got something to give you, but you've got your hands full. Go clear some space and then come back to me. ",
    "WoM_DS_GotHorn2": "It homes in on the spiritual residue of our subject, in this case young Cathan, using this old shoe of his as a spiritual connection. Vile, but useful. Just don't sniff it.",
    "WoM_DS_HasVelgarHead2": "It's not every day you take out a draconic general infused with the elemental power of the earth. But you managed it, well done!",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn3": "Just hunt one down, and bring me the antlers. You can keep all the other useful materials, maybe use them to craft better gear? You're looking a bit shabby.",
    "CathanJournal_Castle_Content": "Just waiting for Spitfoot to bring me the keys, then next stop is the blue-flamed door in the swamps. It holds the secret to Velgar’s destruction, I just know it. For now I’ll bide my time, enjoying the spectacle of goblin hospitality. \r\n\r\nI enjoy being a goblin’s prisoner, there’s a kind of dance to the whole thing. They threaten, they shout, they exclaim all the horrible things they intend to do to you, and then they never go through with it. \r\n\r\nGoblin culture is like that. The strong hold power, but it’s mostly performative -- because if you make yourself too much of a threat, someone’s gonna challenge you to make you prove you deserve it. \r\n\r\nThe dragon hasn’t learned that lesson about goblin faith. \r\n\r\nBandos was a nutjob, Zanik will tell you, but he got his people to behave exactly how he wanted. Conflict for conflict’s sake, everyone just itching to beat up their boss. Which is how I’ve got a few of them wrapped round my finger – because I’ve let it slip that I’m gunning for their god. \r\n\r\nVelgar isn’t a god, he’s just a dragon, but he’s the toughest guy around and so they treat him as such. But I’ve worked out that path to taking him down and enough of these guys are thinking that I can do what I say. So they’re coming with me, we’re making a coup, and big old green-and-scaley’s getting an axe to the face. \r\n\r\nJust as soon as Spitfoot gets here, we’ll make for that blue-flamed swamp door, where there’s a piece of the puzzle that’ll set my plan in motion. \r\n",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToGoblin3": "Look, I hate to ask this, but I need you to go after him. You need to fight your way into Ghornfell and pick up his trail.",
    "Cathan_DS_DoesNotHaveHorn5": "Make the horn, summon the dragon and then kick his ass for me. I'm counting on you, hero, we all are.",
    "WoM_DS_MadeBed2": "Maybe some better lighting? Curtains? A single potted plant? *Sigh* no, no, you're right. It's not important. Why live it up when there's so much squalor to enjoy?",
    "WoM_DS_NotClaimedABed1": "Not finished yet? The longer you leave things, the more likely you are to become a dragon's dinner.",
    "WoM_DS_NotFoundCathanJournal_Castle": "Not found young Cathan yet? Last we heard he'd been captured by the goblins up at the Brynmoor Castle. I'll need you to storm in there and rescue him.",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn1": "Not got the ingredients yet? I need you to hunt a deer and bring me one of their antlers. Deers are flighty creatures, and easily spooked.",
    "WoM_DS_GotHorn4": "Now then, we just need to spread the rune essence like so. Add a dash of this weird unguent stuff Zanik made from snails, and then...",
    "WoM_DS_RefuseToHandOverHead": "OK... not sure why you want to keep a decomposing dragon's head around, but you do you I guess. ",
    "Cathan_DS_TooEarly": "Oh dear... I'm dead...",
    "Goblin_DS_VaultConvo1": "Oh no, not another human. You gonna just leave me to die too? Like the last one did?",
    "CathanJournal_Vannaka_Content": "Old Vannaka’s an odd chap. Loyal to a fault, but not one to show affection. I still remember how he trained me, instilling me with a hatred for him that pushed me right past the pain. He was merciless, he was relentless, his training made me ache every day. So I took months of resentment and I balled them into a fist and with all of my loathing rammed it right into his face.  \r\n\r\nHe was so proud. So proud that I punched him. So pleased with me for bruising his jaw. Because that was the first time I had walked on my new leg, without having to think through every painful motion.\r\n\r\nHe had given me something else to turn my loathing on, that wasn’t myself.\r\n\r\nThat lummox took a broken kid, ready to give up on the world, and turned him into a warrior.\r\n\r\nHe’s a good man, Vannaka, even if he won’t always admit it. So of course, I said I’d join him on this new adventure.\r\n\r\nI feel like there’s more than just a curiosity here for him. Something deeper. Something hidden. A pain behind the eyes. So, yeah, I’ll help him find what he’s looking for. It’s what a good friend does.",
    "Cathan_DS_NotGotAmulet1": "OoooOOOOooOOOOoooOOoooOOOooo!",
    "Description": "Recruited with promises of glory, your first challenge is to defeat General Velgar.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragonkin1": "Relatively little is known about the Dragonkin, less still the ones who set up shop here.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragonkin4": "Secondly, they hoard secrets like they're more valuable than gold... or party hats.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutKuldra3": "She's spoken of not with the reverence due a monarch, but with the devotion due a deity.",
    "Statue.AbyssalWhip.PlayerChoice.GiveSpine": "Show the Abyssal Spine to the statue.",
    "Goblin_DS_VaultConvo4": "So I bet you're just like him, so I aint gonna talk to yous no more. Yeah, that'll teach yas!",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons5": "So here's the deal: I need you to kill them all. Show these dragons and their Queen, that we're not just going to roll over and die.",
    "Cathan_DS_DoesNotHaveHorn1": "So, first off, death sucks. Let's just get that out of the way. I figured I might at least stand a chance against Velgar, I had all the plans, and I am sure I could have beaten him.",
    "WoM_DS_SpokenToGoblin1": "So, young Cathan's pushing his way into Ghornfell, eh? Reckless, as always, that boy's gonna get himself killed.",
    "WoM_DS_FoundCathanJournal2": "Speaking of going places, you mention he's exploring a dragonkin vault in the swamps? I think you probably want to go and take a look. No?",
    "Statue.AbyssalWhip.PlayerChoice.DontGiveSpine": "Step away from the statue.",
    "PlayerChoice_AboutDragons": "Tell me more about these dragons.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutCathan4": "The \"legendary\" swordsman Vannaka taught him the art of swordplay, while I instructed him in the arcane.",
    "WoM_DS_HasVelgarHead1": "The dragon's dead, that's quite the victory. No, really, you should be proud of yourself!",
    "CathanJournal_Ghornfell_Content": "The goblins warn me about Ghornfell and the creatures within it. They call them the garou, and they shiver when they say it. I’ve heard them mention them before, in the stories, myths and legends of this place – beastial warriors, that Bandos came here to destroy. He failed. \r\n\r\nThe god of war, failed to destroy the Garou and their goddess. That should tell you something. \r\n\r\nI’ll be careful. I’ll sneak past their fortifications, I need to get through to the tower that rises in the heard of these Fractured Plains. That’s where Velgar rests. \r\n\r\nThat’s where I’ll destroy him. \r\n",
    "Cathan_DS_NotGotAmulet2": "The spirit gestures emphatically at the backpack on the floor.",
    "Statue.AbyssalWhip.RecipeNotUnlocked": "The statue's shadow flickers strangely, as if it has a will of its own. It promises power, but only for those worthy of overcoming a creature of true darkness. ",
    "Statue.AbyssalWhip.GiveWhip": "The statue's shadow seems to shiver as though giggling with wicked malice. A tendril of night touches you and your mind fills with the knowledge of how to craft a weapon of unnatural power. ",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragonkin5": "Their vaults will be guarded, but well worth exploring. You never know what you might find in there.",
    "Altar_DS_DoesNotHaveRecipe": "There is an indentation in the altar where something would be placed, but you are not sure what it might be. ",
    "Altar_DS_HasHorn": "There is an indentation that would fit the summoning horn, if you are ready to summon Velgar. ",
    "Altar_DS_HasRecipe": "There is an indention in the altar where something would be placed. It looks like it would fit the shape of Cathan's summoning horn design. ",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragonkin3": "They have a penchant for two things that interest us. First, they make dragons, which is the problem we're facing right now.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons3": "They swooped down from the skies and decimated the landing party. Whole teams of people, gone, just like that.",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn_Struggling3": "To hunt deer you'll want a bow. Find some flax and some wood, this should be enough to help you build a spinning wheel. There you'll make thread and with that you can craft a bow.",
    "WoM_DS_HasVelgarHead4": "We can relax for a little while, but not forever. Velgar was one tough cookie, but he's just the foot soldier. Queen Kuldra is out there somewhere and she won't sit quietly for long.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutVelgar2": "We don't know much at the moment, since everyone who's seen him is dead.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons6": "We fight back, and we fight back hard.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragonkin2": "We know that they're ancient, dangerous and constantly angry. They were cursed by the elder gods a long, long, long time ago.",
    "WoM_DS_Intro2": "We need to start thinking long term. Bramblemead village is an excellent place for an outpost, even if it's a little overrun with goblins right now. ",
    "WoM_DS_Intro3": "We should build our new base of operations here. By we, I mean you -- bad back.  ",
    "WoM_DS_GotHorn3": "We'll then just point the antler at the map, and it'll point straight to where we'll find him... or at least where he's been most the last couple of days.",
    "Goblin_DS_VaultConvo3": "Well he got what he wanted, some weird dragonkin stuff, then he said he were heading into Ghornfell and that I'd just slow us down. The others agreed, gits.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutGarou2": "What I know is that the garou are merciless. They'll cut you down without a chance to speak.",
    "WoM_DS_NeedVelgarHead1": "What's that? Velgar's dead? Are you sure? I'll need to see his head, dragons can be tricky like that. ",
    "WoM_DS_AboutDragons1": "When my comrades and I set foot on Ashenfall, we thought it would be paradise. Lush green fields, tall and resilient trees – a world unsullied.",
    "WoM_DS_Intro5": "You can go bigger, of course, let your inner architect run wild, but the bed's the bare minimum we need to get started. Go on, hop to it. Get!",
    "Cathan_DS_KilledVelgar1": "You did it! Velgar got what he deserved. Thank you, hero, now I can rest in peace.",
    "Statue.AbyssalWhip.NotGotSpine": "You lack the trophy the shadow desires. It waits silently for you to bring it what it seeks. Your mind fills with images of flickering purple lightning, and arms like blades. ",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn2": "You'll find it easier to hunt one if you craft yourself a bow of some kind. The deer themselves are all over Bramblemead, finding them shouldn't be a problem.",
    "WoM_DS_NotGotDeerHorn_Struggling1": "You're really struggling with this, aren't you? I'll walk you through exactly what to do, but I can't be holding your hand all the time.",
    "WoM_DS_NotFoundCathanGhost1": "You've made it into Ghornfel, I'm impressed. No, honestly, I expected you to drown in the swamp or something. ",
    "Cathan_DS_HasHorn1": "You've made the horn! Now you can finally avenge me. Use it on the altar in the tower over there.",
    "WoM_DS_AboutCathan2": "Young noble sprog, low down the pecking order. Fifth son, I think. Wanted to be a hero, you know how it goes.",
    "DragonkinKnowledgeStatuesActivate": "Your mind fills with the knowledge of a new crafting recipe... but at what cost?"
  },
