    "FlankSteak": "A thick and juicy steak. ",
    "AdventurersCape": "A thick blue adventurer's cape.",
    "OrangeCape": "A thick orange adventurer's cape.",
    "PurpleCape": "A thick purple adventurer's cape.",
    "YellowCape": "A thick yellow adventurer's cape.",
    "EvasiveInfusion": "A thirst-quenching drink, that improves your reflexes.",
    "FleetFootedInfusion": "A thirst-quenching drink, that puts a spring in your step. ",
    "RoastPumpkin": "A tough but tasty treat.",
    "WildPie": "A triumph of man over nature.",
    "SteelGreataxe": "A two handed Battleaxe forged from Steel.",
    "SteelGreatsword": "A two handed Steel Sword made famous by Highland Warriors.",
    "BronzeGreatsword": "A two-handed bronze sword for those who prefer power over speed.",
    "WoodenArrows": "A very basic arrow.",
    "Naphtha": "A very flammable liquid.",
    "Vestige.ZombieAxe": "A very old and rusted axe, well beyond repair. Still, perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "WeaponPoison": "A vial of Weapon Poison. \r\n\r\nUsed in crafting Poison Arrows or to coat your equipped Melee Weapon with Poison for a short time.",
    "Vestige.ScimitarImaru": "A vicious claw once belonging to Imaru, which was used to try and rip you apart more than a few times. Perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "SteelScimitar": "A vicious, curved sword of Eastern Origins forged from Steel.",
    "BlackCape": "A warm black adventurer's cape.",
    "FortifyingStew": "A warm meat and mushroom stew, fortifies you against the trials ahead.",
    "FortifyingSoup": "A warm vegetable soup, with added mushrooms. ",
    "WhiteCape": "A warm white adventurer's cape.",
    "IronGreatsword": "A well-balanced, large, imposing sword for skilled warriors.",
    "SteelLoggingAxe": "A woodcutter's tool, forged from Steel.",
    "BronzeLoggingAxe": "A woodcutter's tool, forged from bronze.",
    "Trinket.RingOfPursuit.Description": "ANIMALS are less AWARE of your PRESENCE",
    "GreenDragonhideChaps": "Agile Ranged leg armour crafted from Green Dragonhide.",
    "VeganFryup": "All of the calories, none of the guilt. ",
    "Vestige.DragonkinStaff": "Although damaged beyond repair, this staff seethes with ancient power. Perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "WillowShortbow": "An agile Shortbow crafted from Willow.",
    "OakShortbow": "An agile shortbow carved from oak wood.",
    "Vestige.DragonkinRobe": "An ancient robe, tattered beyond repair, but perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "Vestige.BagofNoggin": "An odd bundle of scratchy sackcloth. It\\'s unsettling to hold. Still, perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "ChinchompaCape": "An, artistic, if unusual, cape.",
    "PoisonBoneArrows": "Arrows with tips carved from animal fangs coated in Weapon Poison.",
    "BoneArrows": "Arrows with tips carved from animal fangs. ",
    "PoisonedSteelArrows": "Arrows with tips forged from Steel coated in Weapon Poison.",
    "SteelArrows": "Arrows with tips forged from Steel.",
    "PoisonBronzeArrows": "Arrows with tips forged from bronze coated in Weapon Poison.",
    "BronzeArrow": "Arrows with tips forged from bronze. ",
    "PoisonIronArrows": "Arrows with tips forged from iron coated in Weapon Poison.",
    "IronArrows": "Arrows with tips forged from iron.",
    "StoneArrows": "Arrows with tips of splintered stone.",
    "AstralRune": "Astral runes are used for casting advanced magic spells and attacks. \r\n\r\nRunes are retained if you happen to die.",
    "Vestige.Bootsoflightness": "Barely heavier than a feather, but worn away by time\\'s cruel march. Still, perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "Vestige.PaladinHelm": "Barely more than metal scraps and time-worn leather. Still, perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "AdventurersTunic": "Basic and comfortable attire fit for a new Adventurer.",
    "EnchantedBluriteCrossbowBolts": "Blurite crossbow bolts tipped with enchanted Jade, that have a chance of dealing Earth magic damage and knocking your target down.",
    "Vestige.DeathsShopeGeneric.Weapon": "Broken pieces of an old weapon. Perhaps you can learn something from them.",
    "EnchantedBronzeCrossbowBolts": "Bronze crossbow bolts tipped with enchanted opal, that have a chance to summon a lightning strike around your target, dealing Air magic damage to all nearby enemies.",
    "SteelFireArrows": "Burning arrows with tips forged from Steel coated in fire oil.",
    "FireBronzeArrows": "Burning arrows with tips forged from bronze coated in fire oil.",
    "FireIronArrows": "Burning arrows with tips forged from iron coated in fire oil.",
    "Cadavaberries": "Can be eaten raw, but wouldn't recommend it. Can be cooked alone or as an ingredient in cooking meals.",
    "MagicPotion": "Consume this potion to increase your critical chance with magical attacks. ",
    "BluriteCrossbowBolts": "Crossbow Bolts made from Blurite.",
    "BronzeCrossbowBolts": "Crossbow Bolts made from Bronze.",
    "IronCrossbowBolts": "Crossbow Bolts made from Iron.",
    "SteelBolts": "Crossbow Bolts made from Steel.",
    "DorgeshuunLimbs": "Crossbow limbs made from powerful bone. Used in crafting the Dorgeshuun Crossbow.",
    "BronzeMace": "Crush your foes with this heavy, spiked bronze mace.",
    "IronMace": "Crush your foes with this heavy, spiked iron mace.",
    "bread": "Crusty brown outside, pillowy white inside.",
    "Flour": "Cultivated grains ground to a fine powder.",
    "Decoration": "Decoration",
    "RawPotato": "Don't eat the green bits. ",
    "Ectoplasm": "Dropped from aggressive spirits or extracted from wither hearts. Used in crafting.",
    "HardLeatherScraps": "Dropped from beasts in Fellhollow. Combined at the tannery to create hard leather.",
    "DraconicHide": "Dropped from felled draconic beasts. Can be processed at the tannery.",
    "UndeadBone": "Dropped from the restless dead. Use as a crafting material, or process at a grindstone.",
    "WitheredHeart": "Dropped from withered enemies. Used as a crafting ingredient.",
    "CorpseCotton": "Drops from a volitle bulbous plant that explodes when hit. Can be spun at the  spinning wheel to create fine thread.",
    "StuddedLeatherArmour": "Durable armour crafted from hard leather reinforced with iron studs.",
    "HardLeatherBody": "Durable armour crafted from hard leather.",
    "WildArcherBody": "Durable armour worn by a Wild Knight archer.",
    "WildArcherLegs": "Durable leg armour worn by a Wild Knight archer.",
    "EggFried": "Eggs, sunny side up, a nutritious snack.",
    "FireRune": "Equippable as ammo when using a Magic Weapon (provided the required Skill Perk is unlocked).\r\n\r\nA symbol of blazing heat, essential for fire-based magic. \r\n\r\nRunes are retained if you happen to die.",
    "Airrune": "Equippable as ammo when using a Magic Weapon.\r\n\r\nA symbol of blustering winds, essential for air-based magic and other spells. \r\n\r\nRunes are retained if you happen to die.",
    "TomatoGrilled": "Fire really brings out the flavour. ",
    "FireOilNonThrowable": "Flammable and volatile, handle with care!\r\n\r\nUsed to craft Fire arrows.",
    "BakedPotato": "Fluffy and delicious, if only you had some butter. ",
    "SteelSword": "For fighting monsters and swearing Oaths.",
    "HollowBark": "Found lying around Fellhollow, around long-dead trees. Used in the crafting.",
    "DragonBlood": "Harvested from dragons and dragonwolves. Used as a tanning agent at the tannery.",
    "Irit": "Havested from Thorny Irit Roots, used in potion making at the brewing cauldron.",
    "BeefTomatoSoup": "Hearty, healthy & delicious.",
    "MagicFocus": "Imbue your staff to increase the damage of your magical attacks for a limited time.",
    "Trinket.AmuletOfDefence.Description": "Increased ARMOUR VALUE",
    "Trinket.AmuletOfAccuracy.Description": "Increased CRITICAL DAMAGE",
    "Trinket.SalveAmulet.Description": "Increased DAMAGE to UNDEAD enemies",
    "Trinket.AmuletOfMagic.Description": "Increased MAGIC DAMAGE",
    "Trinket.AmuletOfStrength.Description": "Increased MELEE DAMAGE",
    "EnchantedIronCrossbowBolts": "Iron crossbow bolts tipped with enchanted Jade, that have a chance of dealing Water magic damage and slowing your target. ",
    "FortifyingCrunchies": "It actually smells quite good. ",
    "TatteredCape": "It provides some warmth... barely.",
    "RedberryCrunchies": "It smells quite fruity. ",
    "RoastDinner": "It's not even Sunday.",
    "SteelBarbedArrows": "Lacerating arrows with barbed tips forged from Steel.",
    "BarbedBronzeArrows": "Lacerating arrows with barbed tips forged from bronze.",
    "BarbedIronArrows": "Lacerating arrows with barbed tips forged from iron.",
    "Vestige.WildArcherLegs": "Leathery scraps, victims to entropy\\'s touch. Still, perhaps you could learn something from them. ",
    "DragonkinMageLegs": "Leggings styled after the ancient overlords of Ashenfall.",
    "GreenDragonhideCoif": "Lightweight Ranger headgear crafted from Green Dragonhide for Ranged users",
    "WizardRobes": "Lightweight magical armour.",
    "BoneBolts": "Lightweight, but very sharp. Can be fired using the Dorgeshuun Crossbow.",
    "SteelBar": "Made by smelting coal and iron ore together. A primary ingredient for steel weapons, armour and tools.",
    "GreenDragonhideLeather": "Made by tanning green dragonhide. A key crafting component for armour.",
    "SacredOil": "Made from combining necrotic bonemeal and ectoplasm. Used as a crafting component.",
    "NecroticBonemeal": "Made from ground up undead bone. A useful crafting ingredient.",
    "FineThread": "Made from spun corpse cotton. Can be used as a bow string, and in stitching weapons and gear.",
    "ZombieAxe": "Made in the style of an ancient axe often found in the hands of zombies, it is capable of dealing both Crush and Slash damage at the same time. There seems to be more to this axe though...",
    "SplitbarkBody": "Magical armour crafted from Fine Cloth and Hollow Bark. It has strange magical properties.",
    "DarkMageRobes": "Magical armour for the edgier wizard.",
    "SplitbarkHelm": "Magical head armour crafted from wither corrupted Hollow Bark.",
    "NecromancersCrown": "Magical headgear for those that rule over their undead minions.",
    "SplitbarkLegs": "Magical leg armour armour crafted from wither corrupted Hollow Bark.",
    "NecromancersRobeBottom": "Magical robe bottoms for Sorcerer's that have no concept of ethics.",
    "NecromancersRobeTop": "Magical robes for those who believe that death is only the beginning.",
    "MeatStew": "Meat and vegetables, the classic combination. A warm and pleasant meal. ",
    "FallenHoplitesChest": "Melee chest armour once belonging to a long dead Saradomin Hoplite.",
    "FallenHoplitesTassets": "Melee leg armour once belonging to a long dead Saradomin Hoplite.",
    "Pumpkin": "More treat than trick. Can be cooked by itself or used as an ingredient in cooking meals.",
    "NatureRune": "Nature runes are used for casting transmutation spells. \r\n\r\nRunes are retained if you happen to die. ",
    "NecromancersStaff": "Necromantic essence still eminates from this staff.",
    "Vestige.PaladinLegs": "Nothing but scrap metal now. Still, perhaps you could learn something from them. ",
    "GreenDragonhide": "Obtained from felled Lesser Green Dragons. Can be processed at the tannery.",
    "UndeadMeat": "Obtained from undead beasts. Can be cooked for... interesting results.",
    "TomatoBurnt": "PH",
    "DubiousMeatPie": "Pastry makes everything better.",
    "WeaponBarbs": "Pointy! \r\n\r\nUsed to craft Barbed Arrows or to coat your equipped melee weapon with barbs, causing Bleed buildup for a short duration.",
    "DriedCadavaberries": "Probably not poisonous. A neat little snack. ",
    "ImarusHead": "Proof of your triumph over the Soul-Eater. It's dripping ectoplasm all over, you should probably get rid of it...",
    "IronHelmet": "Protect your head with this sturdy iron headgear.",
    "ReinforcedHelmet": "Protect your noggin with this basic headgear made from Leather and Bone.",
    "LeatherBody": "Protective armour made from leather.",
    "LeatherCowl": "Protective armour made from leather.",
    "ApprenticeRobe": "Provides basic protection for trainees in the magical arts.",
    "ArcaneInfusion": "Puts the whiz in wizard.",
    "GreenDragonhideBody": "Ranged body armour crafted from Green Dragonhide. Form fitting yet intimidating.",
    "ShadowscaleHood": "Ranger Headgear worn by the Skeleton Archer's from Fellhollow.",
    "RangerTunic": "Ranger armour that's as dangerous as it is dapper!",
    "RangerHat": "Ranger head gear. Wearing this gives you the urge to rob from the rich to help the poor for some reason.",
    "RangerTights": "Ranger leg gear that makes you feel both agile and slightly rebellious.",
    "Vestige.DragonDagger": "Remants of a dragon's tooth, perhaps? Looks like it was carved. Perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "LawRune": "Resource needed for teleportation.\r\n\r\nRunes are retained if you happen to die.",
    "Fillet": "Roasted bird meat. Tastes like everything.",
    "Haunch": "Roasted game meat. Tender and tasty.",
    "DragonkinMageRobes": "Robes styled after the ancient overlords of Ashenfall.",
    "Vestige.WildArcher": "Scraps of leather, embroidered with curious patterns. Perhaps you can learn something from it. ",
    "Vestige.HunterStagBow": "Sinew, bound tightly enough to be dangerous. Useless now, but perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "Dwellberries": "Some rather pretty blue berries.",
    "SoulFragment": "Someone may have use for this. ",
    "EnchantedSteelBolts": "Steel crossbow bolts tipped with enchanted Red Topaz. Has a chance to create a necrotic bolt that heals your lifeward for a proportion of the damage dealt.",
    "SteelPlatelegs": "Sturdy and well-made Steel leg armour for Melee users.",
    "DriedDwellberries": "Sweet and chewy, a great fruity snack. ",
    "SoupPumpkin": "Sweet, yet savory. ",
    "SqueakingSausage": "Tail not included.",
    "PungentOmelette": "Tastes much better than it's name suggests.",
    "Vestige.DragonkinRobeLegs": "Tattered remnants of ancient robes. Perhaps you could learn something from them. ",
    "ImaruShield": "The Spirit of Imaru lives on within this shield. ",
    "Vestige.DeathsShopeGeneric.Armour": "The ancient remnants of some sort of armour. Perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "WoodLongbow": "The bane of deer everywhere.",
    "ConstructionCape": "The cape worn by master builders.",
    "ArtisanCape": "The cape worn by master craftworkers.",
    "RunecraftingCape": "The cape worn by master runecrafters.",
    "WoodcuttingCape": "The cape worn by master woodcutters.",
    "AttackCape": "The cape worn by masters of Attack.",
    "MiningCape": "The cape worn by the most skilled miners.",
    "CookingCape": "The cape worn by the world's best chefs.",
    "PrimordialHeart": "The heart of a nature spirit, you hunted this for Vannaka. He wants three of them. ",
    "DraconicVisage": "The image of a fearsome dragon. Used in crafting powerful equipment. ",
    "Vestige.ShortbowWildScouts": "The last few splinters of an ancient shortbow. Perhaps you could learn something from it.",
    "BagOfNoggin": "The only thing this protects is your identity.",
    "Vestige.AdventurersLongbow": "The remains of a longbow, damaged in a dragon attack. Perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "Vestige.PaladinArmour": "The remnants of armour worn long ago by Saradominst knights. Perhaps you can learn something from it. ",
    "Vestige.ChieftainsBlade": "The rusted remains of a symbol of authority. Perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "FallenHoplitesAspis": "The shield of an Undead Hoplite.",
    "DorgeshuunCrossbow": "The signature weapon of the Dorgeshuun Goblin tribe. It fires Bone bolts and is surprisingly well made!",
    "Vestige.UndeadShovel": "The sinister remains of farming equipment. Perhaps you can learn something from it. ",
    "Vestige.DeathsShopeGeneric.Other": "The tattered pieces of a mysterious object. Perhaps you could learn something from them.",
    "ShadowSword": "This Greatsword exsists between the realms of the living and the dead.",
    "UndeadRangersBow": "This bow still fires with undeadly precision.",
    "PoisonIchor": "This stuff looks nasty.",
    "FireOil": "Throw this at your enemies to set them on fire!",
    "GenericBurnt": "Too well done, but still edible. ",
    "Coal": "Typically found in rocky areas and caves. Combine with metal ores at an upgraded smelter to create higher tiered metal bars.",
    "Whetstone": "Use this to hone your equipped melee weapon.",
    "ChefsHat": "What a silly hat.",
    "Vestige.GrievingmoonStaff": "What's left of a staff that feels soaked in sorrow. Perhaps you could learn something from it. ",
    "Trinket.RingOfLife.Description": "When close to DEATH, TELEPORTS you to your current BED",
    "WhitePlatelegs": "White Platelegs worn by a member of the Holy Order of White Knights.",
    "WhitePlatebody": "White platemail armour worn by a member of the Holy Order of White Knights.",
    "MixedPlatter": "Why just eat one animal? A carnivore's delight!",
    "MixedGrill": "Why just eat one animal? A carnivore's favourite.",
    "GarouBow": "With it's aerodynamic antlers, this bow is very popular with Garou scouts.",
    "FineCloth": "Woven from fine thread and gold. Used in weapon and armour crafting.",
    "Cabbage": "Yuck I don't like cabbage.",
    "FriedCabbage": "Yum! Maybe I do like cabbage. ",
    "HeartyCrunchies": "Yum! Smells delicious!",
    "DwellberryCrunchies": "Yum... smells fruity. "
