  "ST_PlayerConsent": {
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph3": "(i)\tAccount Data: including account IDs, character IDs and display names in each case for the relevant game;\r\n(ii)\tLocation Data: a two letter country code for the relevant account and game client;\r\n(iii)\tTransaction Data: such as whether you have purchased products and services from us;\r\n(iv)\tGame Session Data: including the date of last game session start and end date;\r\n(v)\tTechnical Data: such as internet protocol address, platform and other technology you use to access the relevant game;\r\n(vi)\tUsage Data: including information about how you use and interact with our games.\r\n(vii)\tEmail Data: means your email address.",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph6": "(i)\tPlayer Activity and Game Diagnostics:",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph8": "(ii)\tInternet-based Advertising:",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph2": "1.\tThe data we collect\r\n\r\nWe would like to collect the following types of data (‘Player Activity Data’):",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph4": "2.\tPurposes",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph15": "<hyperlink url=\"https://legal.jagex.com/docs/policies/privacy\"/>",
    "ui.playerconsent.title": "ABOUT OUR PLAYER ACTIVITY PLUGIN",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph13": "I consent to collection and use of Data for both Purposes.",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph12": "I consent to the collection and use of Data for Internet-based Advertising.",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph11": "I consent to the collection and use of Data for Player Activity and Game Diagnostics ",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph14": "If you do give us your consent here, you can withdraw your consent at any time by changing your privacy options and preferences in the legal section of the settings menu. The processing of your personal data (including any third parties who we may share the Player Analytics Data with) will be carried out in accordance with our Privacy Policy – copy of which is available on request and also available here:",
    "ui.playerconsent.title2": "MODIFY SETTINGS",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph10": "Please choose what information you are comfortable sharing with us. If you do not opt in using the boxes below, that means we will not collect and use the Player Activity Data for these Purposes. ",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph5": "We would like to use this data for the following purposes (‘Purposes’):",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph1": "You have the option to say yes or no to your data being used for either or both (a) player activity and game diagnostics and/or (b) internet-based advertising. If you say yes, we will automatically collect data through a plug-in developed by the Jagex Group. The collected data is securely stored and analysed on AWS servers in Europe. Your device will be equally secure and operate normally regardless of your decision. ",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph7": "a.\tto analyse and understand player behaviour in our games at an aggregate level;\r\nb.\tto monitor our games for issues affecting players at an aggregate level; \r\nc.\tto identify problems in the game and assist with solutions; and\r\nd.\tto use machine learning to understand trends in the way our games are played and how players progress.",
    "ui.playerconsent.paragraph9": "a.\tto understand and optimise our marketing campaigns;\r\nb.\tto measure the effectiveness of our advertising campaigns;\r\nc.\tto send you offers and promotions related to our games;\r\nd.\tto provide in-game rewards to players who integrate their accounts with relevant marketing channels (including Twitch / Amazon Prime Gaming); and\r\ne.\tto share information with third parties for advertising purposes."
  },
